    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Double, double, tilt and tumble; Bread may burn, but cookies crumble.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The all-in-one, super-sweet, physics-based, gravity-altering, action-packed, bite-sized 2D marble racing game. Now available to-go on Steam Deck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/28c37634de2dadd9dc6475e4a5db1983.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/28c37634de2dadd9dc6475e4a5db1983.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/28c37634de2dadd9dc6475e4a5db1983.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt each stage left and right to navigate the treat to the end. Each stage can be beaten at your own pace in 30 seconds or less, but don't be fooled - you'll need cookie-cutter precision to beat the hardest clear times and earn all all 3 Hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Flavor under the Sun</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/cc4b61c2b7243a109b34316630165674.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/cc4b61c2b7243a109b34316630165674.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/cc4b61c2b7243a109b34316630165674.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cannons to conveyor belts, to bouncy jelly, slippery ice, zero-g static, and surprisingly nice looking water, each recipe has a unique twist to keep you on your toes. Use them to your advantage to shave seconds off your time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Dough for Sweet Treats</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/312cf00804619ec9b1b03398c5c33d74.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/312cf00804619ec9b1b03398c5c33d74.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/312cf00804619ec9b1b03398c5c33d74.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend those hard-earned hearts on some cute, some curious, all of them color-less but definitely not class-less, custom-tailored cosmetics to add a little bit of your own personal flavor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Decaf Here</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/b9c9a68954de28504e3986e4a428e191.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/b9c9a68954de28504e3986e4a428e191.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/b9c9a68954de28504e3986e4a428e191.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is the name of the game in the restaurant business. Mess up? Hit the reset button and be right back at the start in less than a second. Progress and records are saved as you go, so even if your PC takes a spill mid-stage, you'll be able to pick right back up where you left off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some Extra Sugar on Top</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/efc0e065f4ee6617027b490d21b65246.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/efc0e065f4ee6617027b490d21b65246.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/efc0e065f4ee6617027b490d21b65246.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've had your fill of the Main Course, get the ball rolling in extra unlockable game modes. These are no half-baked appetizers though - every one has multiple stages all crafted with the same high-quality ingredients, so be prepared for some interesting flavors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep on Rolling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our menu is constantly expanding with new cosmetics, stages, modes and mini-games baked fresh all the time. No need to rush though - nothing ever spoils, and our seasonal offerings are available year-round.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/e68e7630fd23901c9c66250334483015.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=128 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/e68e7630fd23901c9c66250334483015.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tastes best when served with a controller or device that has gyroscopic capabilities, but it is perfectly playable with touch or a standard mouse and keyboard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Double, double, tilt and tumble; Bread may burn, but cookies crumble.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The all-in-one, super-sweet, physics-based, gravity-altering, action-packed, bite-sized 2D marble racing game. Now available to-go on Steam Deck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/28c37634de2dadd9dc6475e4a5db1983.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/28c37634de2dadd9dc6475e4a5db1983.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/28c37634de2dadd9dc6475e4a5db1983.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt each stage left and right to navigate the treat to the end. Each stage can be beaten at your own pace in 30 seconds or less, but don't be fooled - you'll need cookie-cutter precision to beat the hardest clear times and earn all all 3 Hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Flavor under the Sun</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/cc4b61c2b7243a109b34316630165674.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/cc4b61c2b7243a109b34316630165674.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/cc4b61c2b7243a109b34316630165674.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cannons to conveyor belts, to bouncy jelly, slippery ice, zero-g static, and surprisingly nice looking water, each recipe has a unique twist to keep you on your toes. Use them to your advantage to shave seconds off your time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Dough for Sweet Treats</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/312cf00804619ec9b1b03398c5c33d74.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/312cf00804619ec9b1b03398c5c33d74.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/312cf00804619ec9b1b03398c5c33d74.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend those hard-earned hearts on some cute, some curious, all of them color-less but definitely not class-less, custom-tailored cosmetics to add a little bit of your own personal flavor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Decaf Here</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/b9c9a68954de28504e3986e4a428e191.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/b9c9a68954de28504e3986e4a428e191.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/b9c9a68954de28504e3986e4a428e191.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is the name of the game in the restaurant business. Mess up? Hit the reset button and be right back at the start in less than a second. Progress and records are saved as you go, so even if your PC takes a spill mid-stage, you'll be able to pick right back up where you left off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some Extra Sugar on Top</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/efc0e065f4ee6617027b490d21b65246.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/efc0e065f4ee6617027b490d21b65246.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/efc0e065f4ee6617027b490d21b65246.mp4?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've had your fill of the Main Course, get the ball rolling in extra unlockable game modes. These are no half-baked appetizers though - every one has multiple stages all crafted with the same high-quality ingredients, so be prepared for some interesting flavors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep on Rolling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our menu is constantly expanding with new cosmetics, stages, modes and mini-games baked fresh all the time. No need to rush though - nothing ever spoils, and our seasonal offerings are available year-round.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/e68e7630fd23901c9c66250334483015.poster.avif?t=1750884146\" width=128 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325680/extras/e68e7630fd23901c9c66250334483015.webm?t=1750884146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tastes best when served with a controller or device that has gyroscopic capabilities, but it is perfectly playable with touch or a standard mouse and 