        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any dedicated graphics card.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> No additional specialized support for dedicated sound cards.<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Physics calculations in later stages may be a bit taxing on older (pre-2015) devices.</li></ul>"
